OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mainly cloudy day,
OL,6,Fparticularly for Shetland at first,
OL,7,Fwith just a few bright intervals
OL,8,Fbreaking through. A few showers are
OL,9,Fpossible. Feeling warmer.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will remain largely cloudy
OL,12,Fthrough the evening and overnight with
OL,13,Fsome showery outbreaks of rain, these
OL,14,Fturning heavy at times.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FIt will be cloudy again with
OL,17,Fperhaps some haar at times. Further
OL,18,Foccasionally heavy showers through the
OL,19,Fday, forming longer spells of rain at
OL,20,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
