OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,6,FChangeable with variable amounts of
OL,7,Fcloud and sunny spells. Some showery
OL,8,Fbursts of rain at times too, briefly
OL,9,Fheavy, perhaps more persistent later
OL,10,FSunday. Temperatures back to near
OL,11,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
